Z||000000||fierospeeder||11-16-2001||12:07 AM||||i wasn't alive during the war, but have watched tons of vietnam movies.  <P><BR>i was wondering if there have been people like rambo/chuck norris or a group of people that went back to nam to rescue some of the guys that were still there?   I know there are movies that portray this type of thing and wanted to know if it really happened.<P>As a kid i just remember seeing some 60min reports of vietnam but i cant remember to much.||||reg||1
